{
  "id": 9840259170604,
  "title": "Ducky One X Full Size Inductive Keyboard",
  "body_html": "<ul style=\"padding-left: 16px; margin-bottom: 30px;\" id=\"mkv3_bullets\">\n<li>First keyboard built with Ducky Inductive Analog switches - Ducky Inductive switches deliver superior accuracy, consistency, and power efficiency compared to traditional analog switches</li>\n<li>Gasket mount design with Ducky plate mount stabilizers on stainless steel plate</li>\n<li>Connect 3 ways- wired with USB-C cable or wirelessly with Bluetooth and 2.4 GHz</li>\n<li>Connect up to 4 devices</li>\n<li>QUACK+ mechanics with 7-layer dampening foam including PET, EVA, IXPE, and silicone</li>\n<li>Programmable with web based software that is compatible across various operating systems</li>\n<li>Backlit, OEM profile, Double Shot 85% high-density PBT keycaps</li>\n<li>Adjustable actuation point from 0.2mm - 3.5mm</li>\n<li>2500mAh Polymer Li-ion battery</li>\n<li>NKRO in wired mode and 6KRO in wireless modes</li>\n<li>Protect your keyboard with a <a href=\"https://mechanicalkeyboards.com/products/ducky-silicone-dust-cover\">Ducky Silicone Dust Cover</a>\n</li>\n</ul><div style=\"font-size: 14px;\" id=\"mkv3_description\">Introducing the Ducky One X, a groundbreaking tri-mode wireless mechanical keyboard equipped with next-gen analog switches! Every keystroke delivers an unparalleled experience with Ducky QUACK Mechanics+ incorporating seven dampening layers coupled with Double Shot, high-density 85% PBT keycaps. Plus, streamline your customization and optimize your performance with the intuitive web-based software. Get ready to elevate your typing experience to new heights with the Ducky One X!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nDucky's Next-gen Inductive Switch redefines precision and consistency, delivering 0.1mm key motion accuracy from start to finish (from 0.1mm to 3.5mm). Unlike magnet-based Hall effect switches, which may suffer from inconsistencies or decaying magnet strength, this innovative design ensures consistent, reliable performance and exceptional power efficiency, making it the ideal choice for wireless usage scenarios. These switches pair a composite POM stem with nylon housing for smooth performance no matter what you use them for. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nUp your game with specialty gaming functions! The popular Rapid trigger function resets the key as soon as you start to release it, giving you the ability to trigger it again without moving up past the actuation point or releasing the key completely. With the Multi-point trigger function, assign four actions to a single key depending on depth of press and release. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nBlack has black top and silver grey bottom<br>\r\nWhite has white top and bottom<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n**This keyboard uses specialty analog switches and is not compatible with mechanical or magnetic switches.**</div>\n<p><br><br><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0835/9706/6540/files/Ducky_One_X_100_usermanual_V3_20241029.pdf?v=1739456959\">One X User Manual</a><br><br></p>",
